Micro Clip Studio - Script Editor Developer Center

Micro Clip Studio - Script Editor is a productivity app for short-video creators who want a clear path from idea to publish.

Write and organize shot-by-shot scripts with dialogue, timing, and scene notes. Keep a shooting checklist, generate titles and tags, estimate speech duration, and store hooks, transitions, and CTAs in a reusable copy library.

Track materials and ideas in one place. Schedule publish plans across platforms, set reminders, and see what’s still to shoot, edit, or post—so your weekly output stays steady.

Built for creators who think in scenes, not just timelines. ClipScript keeps the creative workflow local, structured, and ready for the next upload.

What’s inside

Script editor with scenes, dialogue, and duration
Shooting checklist and director-style planning tools
Title & tag helpers, speech timing, and copy library
Idea notes and material records
Publish calendar, status tracking, and reminders

